# Core Rules

Rule 1

Recent activity is more valuable than historical activity.

---

Rule 2

Independent agreement is stronger than copying.

---

Rule 3

Large positions indicate higher conviction.

---

Rule 4

Experts receive more influence inside their specialty.

---

Rule 5

Consensus must form naturally.

---

Rule 6

Markets are grouped by ideas, not only exact contracts.

---

Rule 7

Every prediction must be measurable.

---

Rule 8

Oracle-AI never guesses.

It only measures evidence.
